WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:02.600
Which is bigger, 342 or 328?

2
00:02.600 --> 00:05.000
Line up the places.

3
00:05.000 --> 00:07.900
Start with the hundreds. 3 and 3 are the same.

4
00:07.900 --> 00:09.900
They match, so check the tens.

5
00:09.900 --> 00:12.700
4 tens is more than 2 tens.

6
00:12.700 --> 00:16.200
So 342 is bigger than 328.
